Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.52,0:00:34.35,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.81,0:01:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still looking for\Na place to find a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still looking for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to be\Nable to fight the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to fight the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,RAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.02,0:02:06.11,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,930)\pos(175,700)\fscx83}Episode 25: Iggy the Fool and Geb's N'Doul, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you hear that noise too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the update, Captain Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here from the\NSpeedwagon Foundation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're looking for somewhere to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed Wagon Foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct me if I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.19,0:02:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but aren't they the group that's\Nlooking after Mom back in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're old friends of yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we taking a helicopter\Nfrom here on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to, the guys working\Nfor the Foundation aren't stand users,!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we'd be putting them in\Nharm's way if we hitched a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they're not here to give us\Na ride, what's the occasion, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They brought us our new ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turigol? An ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to warn you,\Nhe's a bit of a handful,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is the primary reason\Nit took so long to fetch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:02:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, you aren't seriously\Nconsidering taking him with us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His presence here would only hold us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he might actually harm us? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.01,0:03:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This new ally of ours, are you\Nsaying that he's a stand user too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, and his stand is\Nrepresented by the card known as the Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the fool? Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pretty stupid\Ncard if you want my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should count your blessings\Nthat he's on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest watching your mouth if\Nyou know what's good for you, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now move your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who died and made you the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The helicopter's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, which one of you is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're gonna answer\Nme or not? Is it you, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir neither of us is the\Nuser he's actually in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back huh I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't see anyone no he's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there hey hey cut it out\Ncome on quit Joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal? Is the guy\Nreally short or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird. What the hell is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:05:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful, it was a rough\Ncopter ride so he's in a foul mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step away, I've already told\Nyou this guy is trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back Polnareff, you cannot beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.57,0:05:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is asking where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this dog is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, this dog possesses\Nthe stand of the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Iggy, and he's crazy about\Nripping chunks of hair out of people's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest with you, I'm\Nnot sure where he's from,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Avdol found him in New York after none\Nof the dog catchers could wrangle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's thanks to Avdol that\Nhe's not roaming the streets now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's something that I\Nprobably should have mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's in the middle of\Nripping out someone's hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he likes to, uh, pass gas in their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a disgusting habit, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that thing is the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were in Singapore, we fought\Nan orangutan stand user, but this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does this stupid mutt\Nthink he is? Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me turn you into dog meat!
