Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turned into sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't cut him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand is solidified and\Ngrabbed hold of my rapier! Is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the dog's stand is\Nmade entirely out of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, as simple as the design is, it's so\Npowerful I'm not sure I could land a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, what are you doing? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this dog off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.49,0:07:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Polnareff, but if it's all the\Nsame to you, I'd like to keep my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to bring his\Nfavorite snack with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have come with us otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog's sense of smell is\Nsimply incredible. And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coffee-flavored chewing gum.\NIggy will do just about anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to savor this tasty little morsel. No! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, quickly, hide\Nthe packet before you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He grabbed the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't get enough of his\Ncoffee-flavored gum, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People, on the other hand, are a\Ndifferent story, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least he can do is\Ntake the wrapping off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is a gum-obsessed feral\Ndog supposed to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little menace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely ruined\Nmy picturesque hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:07:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Partied corn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be distracted while\Nhe's chewing his gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get the supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the food and water you'll\Nbe needing for your trip, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are medical supplies\Nand a change of clothes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also took the liberty of buying\Na new camera to use with your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose it'll be a lot\Neasier than using a TV, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look sharp, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.27,0:08:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.19,0:08:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eftel, hurry up and\Ngive the Avdol the gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why in the world would I do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when the two of you are already\Nsuch good friends, Folder F?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's everything, I think\Nwe're going to be heading back now, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer this before you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's regarding my daughter's condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want you to be straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's my baby girl holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be perfectly frank with you,\Nsir, it's not looking good right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's rapidly losing strength and\Nnothing seems to help her condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our doctors at the Speedwagon Foundation\Nsay she has two weeks at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all out of time. This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also have some other information sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our investigators say that two days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nine unidentified men and women gathered\Nin a building believed to be Dio's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they came and left together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio has rounded up nine more people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no clue who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spy who reported this\Nwas killed shortly after,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the mansion where\Nthey met has been vacated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had no luck in\Nlocating these individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought about tailing them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:10:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since our spies aren't stand users,\Nwe decided it would be too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these people are stand users? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than whole horses stand the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only tarot card that\Nstill remains is the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been suspecting that one\Nbelongs to Dio, but now I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.31,0:10:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't wrap my head around this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine more stand users?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I can gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems that Dio's head hasn't been\Nable to adjust to his new body yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that monster would never run from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's far too conceited\Nfor something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll do everything within his\Npower to keep us out of Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to take out nine\Nstand users in two weeks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that is one hell of a whirlwind tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We await your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look after my holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it sniffed out the great\NEndul from that far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost caught it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more practice, all of\Nthis because of the tsetse fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not for those insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:12:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe Starr and his band of meddlers would\Nnever have known Master Dio was in Egypt.
