Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, why are you letting\Nhim get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not Farragus to be in the backseat\Nwhile we're stuck in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in case you didn't know, it's\Nnot exactly spacious back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need a chiropractor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I know it's not ideal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.39,0:12:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you'll just have to wait\Nuntil the gum runs out of flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.21,0:12:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it does, throw another stick of gum\Ninto the trunk to lure him back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can all switch seats. All\Nright. All right. Calm down! Already
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fleabag damn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.49,0:12:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're annoying whoa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:13:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell was that hey quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look over there there do you see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it it's the helicopter the speed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wagon foundation helicopter went\Ndown i can't believe what i'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of an\Nexplosion or gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.47,0:13:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like it just fell out\Nof the sky for no reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be? Careful, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my life it was\Nattacked by an enemy's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.35,0:13:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to\Nhim, it wasn't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Approach carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, whatever did this\Ncould still be hiding in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way all that\Nwater is just from his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be flowing from somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be from his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fish would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He drowned in the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting weirder and weirder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the other guy\Nover here! He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to talk to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you need water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Polnareff, hand me the canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.43,0:14:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.73,0:14:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:14:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water attacked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, watch yourselves. It's a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's stand is inside the canteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just innocent bystanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What reason did it have to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, did you see what kind\Nof stand we're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw the shape of a hand, but I'd\Nwager it's still inside the canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe I saw it leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could the user be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Foundation members informed us Dio\Nhad a meeting with nine men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that one\Nof them is the assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I need you to find the\Nstand user. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already on it. That said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything around\Nus, let alone the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we duked it out with that sun\Nstand, he was hiding behind a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:15:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the enemy seems to be so far away that\Nwe'll never be able to find him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, slice up\Nthe canteen, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, didn't you see\Nwhat happened to the pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His entire head got sucked into\Nthat tiny little container.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.77,0:16:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I so much as poke a\Nhole in that thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you slice it up, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're closer anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can just use your emerald\Nsplash and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I don't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me do something just\Nbecause you don't want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've said no and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like I said, I'm not gonna\Nattack the damn thing either
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:16:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand left the canteen disguised\Nas water and hid in the blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand wasn't disguising\Nitself as water at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the stand is the water! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It closed up Kakuin's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, panicking isn't\Ngoing to help anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summon Chariot for protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it'll get Polnareff too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would it go after the pilot's corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't the corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The target was the watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It attacked the watch\Nbecause of the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:17:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand stalks its victims\Nby sound! You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, Polaramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming after you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get to the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, pull the raft!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand disappeared into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It detects sound through\Nvibrations in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it moves through the Earth,\Nso there's no way to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That puts us at a major disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we can't see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Stand has the ability to attack from\Nabove or below at any moment it chooses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make things worse, the Stand\Nuser could be kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Prey has sought\Nrefuge atop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they've realized Until is using the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power of sound to hunt\Nthem down one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before\Nthey're all eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's Kakyoin doing? Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things,\Nhe may have been blinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs to see a doctor\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we try to move from this\Nspot that stand will attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford careless mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.39,0:20:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound it's the dog interesting it\Nleapt out of the car before i could attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It anticipated what my\Nstand was going to do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems like this dog is\Ngoing to be quite the!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuisance the tires are\Nin the water shit what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now the whole car's about to be pulled in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold him for long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone we have to move to the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you good for nothing mongrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be\Nhelping us or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that a cursed dog is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too perceptive for his own good it knows\NI'm four kilometers west of Joestar's!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:20:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Group
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should do away\Nwith the dog right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.49,0:21:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, leave while we fight to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bastard, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, the dog is of no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.69,0:21:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others can't\Ncontrol that mongrel anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mutt's harmless if all it does is nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water's sharp enough to\Nslash through our front tires!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move to the other side on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.09,0:21:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's trying to do what I think it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we're gonna need to\Nhang on for our lives!
